{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talaka</strong> is a fast-paced, combat-driven roguelite that brings Afro-Brazilian mythology to life in a vivid, hand-painted world unlike anything you've seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young warrior who once believed in the old legends\u2014the stories of Orisha gods, mystical creatures, and ancient realms. But as time passed, the myths faded. Forgotten by the world, the legends have begun to unravel\u2014twisting into chaos, breaking the harmony between worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must journey across dreamlike landscapes, reconnect with divine forces, and uncover why the myths have gone rogue. With the Orisha by your side, you\u2019ll fight to restore balance before the stories vanish forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring lightning-fast action, dynamic roguelite runs, and a stunning watercolor-inspired art style, <i>Talaka</i> turns your controller into a paintbrush and every battle into a living canvas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you rewrite the myth\u2014or let it fade into oblivion?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Battle Brazilian Demi-Gods</strong><br>Face off against powerful Orishas and twisted legends that once protected the land. Each boss fight is a cosmic clash\u2014demanding skill, timing, and deep knowledge of mythic patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/49f64a02c1f91731690d95ce104ce079.poster.avif?t=1758129412\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/49f64a02c1f91731690d95ce104ce079.webm?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/49f64a02c1f91731690d95ce104ce079.mp4?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>A Living Canvas of Culture</strong><br>Explore lush, watercolor-painted biomes inspired by Afro-Brazilian heritage, Candombl\u00e9 rituals, and jungle folklore. Every area is alive with ancestral magic and hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/d6d21133a742e1c05f0506f53a2fe462.poster.avif?t=1758129412\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/d6d21133a742e1c05f0506f53a2fe462.webm?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/d6d21133a742e1c05f0506f53a2fe462.mp4?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Dynamic Roguelite Combat</strong><br>Every run offers new challenges, powers, and god-blessed weapons. Dodge, parry, and paint your way through corrupted spirits and celestial beasts in fast-paced, reactive combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/a3286879406c64fce15fb1e708f190cb.poster.avif?t=1758129412\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/a3286879406c64fce15fb1e708f190cb.webm?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/a3286879406c64fce15fb1e708f190cb.mp4?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Choose Your Path</strong><br>Shape Talaka\u2019s fate through branching narratives, blessings from gods, and critical moral choices. Will you bring peace\u2014or become the next legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/876a89f937fb48f2cf6e022b775d30d0.avif?t=1758129412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras_big/876a89f937fb48f2cf6e022b775d30d0.avif?t=1758129412 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>A Soundtrack Rooted in Spirit</strong><br>Experience drums, chants, and melodies crafted in collaboration with Afro-Brazilian musicians, evoking the divine rhythm of a world on the edge of rebirth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Mythvania Gameplay Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, fluid, high-stakes combat</strong> with panic-rolls, parries, and god-tier weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic runs</strong> with ever-changing relics, mutations, and divine boons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No checkpoints</strong>: learn enemy patterns, grow stronger, try again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new paths and powers</strong> after each attempt\u2014open shortcuts, discover forbidden shrines, and bargain with ancient spirits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Afro-Brazilian mythology</strong> brought to life through hand-painted art, mythic enemies, and original soundscapes rooted in ritual</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815370?t=1758129412","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815370?t=1758129412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/e07531961f2de8eef029c0dbcfb99c8e11dcb2d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758129412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/e07531961f2de8eef029c0dbcfb99c8e11dcb2d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758129412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Talaka</strong> is a fast-paced, combat-driven roguelite that brings Afro-Brazilian mythology to life in a vivid, hand-painted world unlike anything you've seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young warrior who once believed in the old legends\u2014the stories of Orisha gods, mystical creatures, and ancient realms. But as time passed, the myths faded. Forgotten by the world, the legends have begun to unravel\u2014twisting into chaos, breaking the harmony between worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must journey across dreamlike landscapes, reconnect with divine forces, and uncover why the myths have gone rogue. With the Orisha by your side, you\u2019ll fight to restore balance before the stories vanish forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring lightning-fast action, dynamic roguelite runs, and a stunning watercolor-inspired art style, <i>Talaka</i> turns your controller into a paintbrush and every battle into a living canvas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you rewrite the myth\u2014or let it fade into oblivion?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Battle Brazilian Demi-Gods</strong><br>Face off against powerful Orishas and twisted legends that once protected the land. Each boss fight is a cosmic clash\u2014demanding skill, timing, and deep knowledge of mythic patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/49f64a02c1f91731690d95ce104ce079.poster.avif?t=1758129412\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/49f64a02c1f91731690d95ce104ce079.webm?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/49f64a02c1f91731690d95ce104ce079.mp4?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>A Living Canvas of Culture</strong><br>Explore lush, watercolor-painted biomes inspired by Afro-Brazilian heritage, Candombl\u00e9 rituals, and jungle folklore. Every area is alive with ancestral magic and hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/d6d21133a742e1c05f0506f53a2fe462.poster.avif?t=1758129412\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/d6d21133a742e1c05f0506f53a2fe462.webm?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/d6d21133a742e1c05f0506f53a2fe462.mp4?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Dynamic Roguelite Combat</strong><br>Every run offers new challenges, powers, and god-blessed weapons. Dodge, parry, and paint your way through corrupted spirits and celestial beasts in fast-paced, reactive combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/a3286879406c64fce15fb1e708f190cb.poster.avif?t=1758129412\" width=780 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/a3286879406c64fce15fb1e708f190cb.webm?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/a3286879406c64fce15fb1e708f190cb.mp4?t=1758129412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded <strong>Choose Your Path</strong><br>Shape Talaka\u2019s fate through branching narratives, blessings from gods, and critical moral choices. Will you bring peace\u2014or become the next legend?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras/876a89f937fb48f2cf6e022b775d30d0.avif?t=1758129412\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/extras_big/876a89f937fb48f2cf6e022b775d30d0.avif?t=1758129412 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>A Soundtrack Rooted in Spirit</strong><br>Experience drums, chants, and melodies crafted in collaboration with Afro-Brazilian musicians, evoking the divine rhythm of a world on the edge of rebirth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Mythvania Gameplay Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, fluid, high-stakes combat</strong> with panic-rolls, parries, and god-tier weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic runs</strong> with ever-changing relics, mutations, and divine boons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No checkpoints</strong>: learn enemy patterns, grow stronger, try again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new paths and powers</strong> after each attempt\u2014open shortcuts, discover forbidden shrines, and bargain with ancient spirits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Afro-Brazilian mythology</strong> brought to life through hand-painted art, mythic enemies, and original soundscapes rooted in ritual</p></li></ul>","developers":["Potato Kid"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/42a83b8be0585685ba0b24d1fb0e978a626ef395/header.jpg?t=1758129412","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3815370/779129686/47e65de1951b46ff09f6fa7443cf531ad68629cf/1756818437/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757529117","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3815370/779129686/47e65de1951b46ff09f6fa7443cf531ad68629cf/1756818437/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757529117","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3815370/779129686/47e65de1951b46ff09f6fa7443cf531ad68629cf/1756818437/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757529117","id":257156540,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156540/movie480.mp4?t=1757529117","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156540/movie_max.mp4?t=1757529117"},"name":"Talaka - PlayAcclaim 