.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/eb957fee0cd499cf47144f635017870f453b17fb/ss_eb957fee0cd499cf47144f635017870f453b17fb.600x338.jpg?t=1758129412"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/d2d0779daa43855bf7eac318fd757f7ceaa2bacf/ss_d2d0779daa43855bf7eac318fd757f7ceaa2bacf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758129412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/d2d0779daa43855bf7eac318fd757f7ceaa2bacf/ss_d2d0779daa43855bf7eac318fd757f7ceaa2bacf.600x338.jpg?t=1758129412"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/69a49831b49da0d93367d5391d03254e6a3b4f55/ss_69a49831b49da0d93367d5391d03254e6a3b4f55.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758129412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/69a49831b49da0d93367d5391d03254e6a3b4f55/ss_69a49831b49da0d93367d5391d03254e6a3b4f55.600x338.jpg?t=1758129412"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/3e75733fdd4629149135c9b3a987e53fa0c39d1d/ss_3e75733fdd4629149135c9b3a987e53fa0c39d1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758129412","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815370/3e75733fdd4629149135c9b3a987e53fa0c39d1d/ss_3e75733fdd4629149135c9b3a987e53fa0c39d1d.600x338.jpg?t=1758129412"}],"short_description":"Dive into a hand-painted world where myths come alive and turn against you. Unravel branching stories shaped by ancient Gods, explore lush, vibrant landscapes, and battle corrupted creatures from Afro-Brazilian folklore that threaten the balance of the realms. Destiny calls. The Gods are watching.","steam_appid":3815370,"support_info":{"email":"paulo@alchemy.games","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://playacclaim.com/talaka/"}